{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01084","headline":"相和歌辞 王昭君 · 梁献","name":"相和歌辞 王昭君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"图画失天真，容华坐误人。\n君恩不可再，妾命在和亲。\n泪点关山月，衣销边塞尘。\n一闻阳鸟至，思绝汉宫春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁献","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}